## DOCKER STACK ARCHITECTURE

AIANA runs as a 3-container stack:

  Container        | Role                              | Port(s)
  -----------------|-----------------------------------|----------
  aiana            | Main service, MCP server, watcher | 8765
  aiana-redis      | Session cache, user preferences   | 6379 (default)
  aiana-qdrant     | Vector database, semantic search  | 6333, 6334

Shared infrastructure with n8n fabric:
  n8n-fabric-qdrant — separate Qdrant instance for n8n's fabric layer (6343-6344)
  AIANA does NOT share its Qdrant with n8n. Isolation is intentional.

Start command: aiana start --scan
