## MCP TOOL REFERENCE

AIANA exposes its tools via MCP server on port 8765.
Transport: HTTP SSE or stdio (configurable)
Connection string for Claude Desktop: http://localhost:8765/mcp

### memory_search
  Description: Semantic search across stored memories using vector similarity
  Args: {query: str, limit?: int (default 5), project?: str, role?: str}
  Returns: [{content, score, session_id, project, timestamp, tags}]
  Backend: Qdrant semantic search → augmented by SQLite FTS for keyword boost
  ⚠ Non-functional until Qdrant vector indexing issue is resolved

### memory_add
  Description: Explicitly save a memory to AIANA
  Args: {content: str, project?: str, tags?: [str], role?: str}
  Returns: {id: str, status: "stored"}
  Writes to: SQLite + Qdrant (via Mem0 for dedup) + Redis cache invalidation
  Use for: important decisions, architectural choices, preferences to remember

### memory_recall
  Description: Recall project-specific context — most recent + most relevant
  Args: {project: str, limit?: int}
  Returns: [{content, role, timestamp}] ordered by relevance + recency
  Combines: Qdrant semantic recall + SQLite recency filter
  Best for: "What have we done on project X?" before starting a session

### session_list
  Description: List recorded sessions
  Args: {project?: str, limit?: int, since?: datetime}
  Returns: [{session_id, project, message_count, start_time, end_time}]
  ⚠ Known issue: Shows 0 sessions despite 229 recorded messages
    Session grouping logic may be broken (session_id → session association)

### session_show
  Description: Show full session detail
  Args: {session_id: str}
  Returns: {session_id, messages: [{role, content, timestamp}]}

### preference_add
  Description: Store a user preference (persistent across sessions)
  Args: {key: str, value: str, scope?: "persistent"|"temporary"}
  Writes to: Redis (aiana:pref:{user}:{key})
  Auto-loaded at: session start (if hooks configured)

### aiana_status
  Description: Health and status check for all AIANA backends
  Args: {} (none)
  Returns:
    {
      "status": "healthy|degraded|unhealthy",
      "backends": {
        "sqlite": {"status": "ok", "message_count": 229, "db_size_kb": 660},
        "redis": {"status": "ok", "memory_mb": 1.07},
        "qdrant": {"status": "ok|warning", "vector_count": 0, "collection": "aiana_memories"},
        "mem0": {"status": "ok"}
      },
      "watcher": {"status": "running|stopped", "path": "~/.claude/projects/"},
